      "en": "Because of the ground which is cracked, because no rain has been in the land, the plowmen are disappointed. They cover their heads.",
      "ko": "땅에 비가 없어 지면이 갈라지니 밭가는 자가 부끄러워서 그 머리를 가리는도다",
      "source_text_hash": "d596dde257d67b54b990efb0c744f543f893377375a79589dab8aab264f3832f",
      "translation_text_hash": "315a83a39749dfb4239ce997d3803d94ec47e82aa81dcc62ea0ef74ae8497c4c",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
